abstract: "An academic-grade, memory-safe, freestanding C++20 Windows NT Kernel Driver framework featuring a polymorphic memory management subsystem, 4-level x86-64 MMU paging translation engine, zero-copy lockless ring buffer communication channel, and an isolated virtual hardware MMU sandbox."
